Symbols Nerd Font Mono, from Nerd Fonts v3.5.1 (NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.zip),
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/tag/v3.5.1

Shipped unmodified as SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.ttf. Bedrock Engineer uses it only as a
fallback font in its terminals, so prompt icons (Starship, Powerlevel10k and the like) render.

